TITLE: Full call sign cases
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall expect November one two three alpha bravo for N123AB and November niner zero zulu for N90Z, and shall reject N0123, N123I, and n123ab. Acceptance is those spoken forms and those three rejections. The test file is apps/aircraft/tests/test_callsign.py.
<<<
